{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/dematerialize\/share()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Dematerialize"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"code":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that multicasts elements to multiple consumers concurrently."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This operator is an alias for ","type":"text"},{"code":"broadcast()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", providing identical behavior.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It enables multicasting of values from the upstream sequence to multiple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"concurrent consumers without duplicating upstream work. A consumer receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the elements the shared sequence reads from the upstream after the consumer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"creates its iterator; elements already read and handed out are not replayed.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","text":"Example","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Create an AsyncStream that emits 3 random values between 1 and 5","let upstream = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.finish()","}","","let sharedSequence = upstream.share()","","async let firstConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"First consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","async let secondConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"Second consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","\/\/ A consumer that subscribes after the shared sequence has handed out values misses them.","await firstConsumer.value","await secondConsumer.value"]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"ShareSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/ShareSequence.swift#L113"},"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"extendedModule":"_Concurrency","title":"share()","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragmen